  "lastWords" : "I filled the hole in `*-distribˡ-+`, and check_file reports success on the final file (exit code 0, no diagnostics, no holes left).\n\nThe proof is a chain of three equalities, linked with `trans`:\n\n1. `*-comm` turns `m * (n + p)` into `(n + p) * m`.\n2. `*-distribʳ-+` turns that into `n * m + p * m`.\n3. `cong₂ _+_` with `*-comm` on each side gives `m * n + m * p`.\n\nTo use `trans`, I imported it from `Relation.Binary.PropositionalEquality` in a local `where` block, so the existing import lines are unchanged.",
